      description: `This Tiny pot bears relief scenes of heroes on its cast iron sides. You can use the cauldron as a spell casting focus for your spells, and it functions as a suitable component for the Scrying spell. When you finish a long rest, you can use the cauldron to create a Potion of Greater Healing. The potion lasts for 24 hours, then loses its magic if not consumed.
